    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Campbells are delighted to present this Beautiful Family Home to the open market.\n\nLocated in the popular Gaeltacht Area of Derrybeg\n\nThe Property is ideally situated close to Teach Jack`s Pub and Restaurant along with a range of Local Amenities, making it suitable as both a Family Home or Holiday Property.\n\nThe Ground Floor Accommodation includes a wide Entrance Hall, a bright and spacious Living Room, a fully fitted open plan Kitchen and Dining Area, Family Bathroom, Utility Room and a Master Bedroom with En Suite.\n\nThe First Floor comprises of three additional Bedrooms, one has an (En Suite) a upstairs Bathroom and a Walk in Wardrobe\n\nViewing is by STRICT appointment with Campbells.\n\nOur Ref: K1325"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall - 6.79m (22'3\") x 5.82m (19'1\")\nLarge Tiles\n\nLiving Room - 5.14m (16'10\") x 4.01m (13'2\")\nOpen Fireplace, Large Tiled Floor\n\nMaster Bedroom (En Suite) - 4.25m (13'11\") x 3.63m (11'11\")\nLarge Tiled Floor\n\nEn Suite (Mst Bed) - 2.79m (9'2\") x 1.66m (5'5\")\nTiled Floor, Half Tiled Wall, Shower Fully Tiled, Hand Basin, Toilet\n\nMain Bathroom - 2.94m (9'8\") x 2.4m (7'10\")\nLarge Floor Tiles,Half Tiled Wall, Bath, Hand Basin, Toilet\n\nStorage Cupboard - 2m (6'7\") x 0.7m (2'4\")\nFitted Shelving\n\nKitchen - 5.45m (17'11\") x 3.92m (12'10\")\nOpen Plan, Fully Fitted, Rage Cooker, Large Floor Tiles\n\nDining Room - 5.3m (17'5\") x 3.48m (11'5\")\nLarge Floor Tiles, Solid Fuel Stove, Sliding Doors to Rear\n\nUtility Room - 3.73m (12'3\") x 3.1m (10'2\")\nLarge Floor Tiles, Fitted Units\n\nLanding Area - 2.23m (7'4\") x 2.01m (6'7\")\nSolid Wooden Floor\n\nBedroom 2 (En Suite) - 4.26m (14'0\") x 4.16m (13'8\")\nSolid Wooden Floor\n\nEn Suite (Bed 2) - 3.01m (9'11\") x 1.4m (4'7\")\nTiled Floor and Half Wall, Shower(Electric), Hand Basin, Toilet\n\nBedroom 3 - 5.17m (17'0\") x 2.8m (9'2\")\nSolid Wooden Floor\n\nUpstairs Bathroom - 2.42m (7'11\") x 1.63m (5'4\")\nTiled Floor and Half Wall, Shower(Electric), Hand Basin,Toilet\n\nBedroom 4 - 4.83m (15'10\") x 2.78m (9'1\")\nSolid Wooden Floor,\n\nWalk in Wardrobe - 3.46m (11'4\") x 3.14m (10'4\")\nSolid Wooden Floor,\n\nNotice\nPlease note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only."
      },
